		<property name="note">
			<value>Ambiance Manager
Labled Parameter Used for the Locations
Magnet Regions used for snapping between the 2 Ambiances, loop regions placed over both to keep the ambiances looping

Value 0 = Outside Ambiance
Value 1 = Inside/Cave Ambiance

Outside Ambiance Parameters:
Cricket Intensity Parameter
Value 0 = Cricket sounds
Value 0.35 - 1 = Intense Cricket Sounds
Bird Intensiry Parameter:
Value 0 = Bird Sounds
Value 0.5 - 1 = High pitched bird sounds ontop of the original
Wind Parameter:
Value 0 = only noise
Value 0.05 = more wind
Value 0.4 = alot of wind

Inside/Cave Parameters:
</value>
